\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Wall Mount task evaluation.} The manipulator, mounted horizontally on the near wall, must navigate to and from the opposing shelf. Faded overlays represent the RRT-generated trajectory. This configuration evaluates a morphology's ability to resist gravity in atypical base orientations while navigating constrained pick-and-place trajectories.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
