\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Shelf task evaluation.} The manipulator navigates around a floating shelf obstacle, moving from a start pose (blue marker) to a goal pose (red marker). Transparent models illustrate the intermediate joint-space trajectory, concluding at the opaque target configuration. This task specifically tests the morphology's capability to maneuver through vertically constrained spaces and perform complex over-and-under reaching motions typical in industrial pick-and-place operations.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:shelfTask}{{4}{5}{}{}{}}
